      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JILLIBY SNIPER (2) turned in an out-of-character effort last start when 14 metres away in seventh over 2760m at Melton. Form prior to that had been solid. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Finds a suitable assignment and can make amends. RANGER RICK NZ (5) brought some very good form to the table before the latest appearance when he finished 1.5 metres away in third over 1690m at Maryborough. His last-start form is good enough to take out a race like this. HAPPILY (1) comes here following a eighth behind The Art Of Success at Group Two level a month ago over 2240m at Melton. Ideally drawn and can play a big role. BROWNIESATMIDNIGHT (8) is capable of better after finishing well back when resuming over 2240m at Melton a month ago.",
